@startuml
left to right direction
actor "DMS Department Manager/HOD" as Manager
rectangle "APGC DMS — department responsibility" {
  usecase "Review assigned task\n[CURRENT: task assignment, not role]" as AssignedReview
  usecase "Resolve department head actor\n[CURRENT: if workflow step selects it]" as DeptHead
  usecase "View eligible department documents\n[FUTURE: policy + classification scope]" as DeptView
  usecase "Monitor department pending actions\n[FUTURE]" as Queue
  usecase "Manage delegated department actions\n[FUTURE: explicit authorization]" as Manage
}
Manager --> AssignedReview
Manager --> DeptHead
Manager ..> DeptView : target behavior
Manager ..> Queue : target behavior
Manager ..> Manage : target behavior
note bottom of DeptView
  Department membership or headship does not currently
  grant document visibility. Combine DMS role, current
  assignment, ownership/task/grant, and classification.
end note
@enduml
